# Only image/, controller/ and the web UI's sources are needed to build; everything else stays out of
# the build context.
*
!image/
!controller/
# The web UI (the webui stage): its sources, and docs/brand for the logo it imports. Not its
# node_modules (npm ci runs in the image), the design drawings, or the output of tests and builds.
!web/
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/design-reference
web/test-results*
web/playwright-report
web/blob-report
web/e2e/screenshots
!docs/
docs/*
!docs/brand/
# The controller's local venv, fake-mode data and tool caches.
controller/.venv
controller/.dev
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
